# []G_ENSYM gives a macro a fresh name for its text (MC30); it is a
# macro hook, so a program cannot call it (MC20).
== SOURCE
[]G_ENSYM "t"
== ERROR
error[hook-outside-macro]: []G_ENSYM is a macro hook: it works only in a macro body, while a call is expanded
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | []G_ENSYM "t"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
